# Audit disposition — 151 findings

The audit is partially substantiated. This table covers every numbered finding
in the supplied 950-line report; it does not declare all suggestions implemented
or every affected product feature accepted. Current source checks, patches and
limits are in governance.md, visual.md, root-docs.md, succession.md and report.md.
No external URL/book claim was revalidated merely from the auditor’s memory.

